# Persist returns Kitchen Finks "with a -1/-1 counter on it" (CR 702.79a): a counter an effect puts on it as it enters (CR
# 122.6, 614.1c), so Doubling Season, which doubles counters of any kind an effect puts on a permanent Bot1 controls, makes it
# two. The 3/2 returns a 1/0 and dies to the state-based action (CR 704.5f), now with -1/-1 counters, so persist does not
# return it again: it is in the graveyard for good. Its enters trigger still resolves for the return, so Bot1 gains 2 + 2.

